{"id": 1464, "title": "Internet and cellphone", "level": "Advanced", "hsk_tags": ["HSK5"], "slug": "internet-and-cellphone", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1464_internet-and-cellphone.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我最近情绪不太好。女儿自从结婚以来，就很少回来看我们了。我们之间的距离越来越大。虽说她每天要么和我们打视频电话，要么给我们短信，但是却少了很多面对面的交流。现在的技术很先进，我却更想念那些温馨的家庭气氛，而不是冷冰冰的手机和电脑。我决定每个星期和所有家人一起聚一聚，忽略手机和电脑，珍惜我们在一起的时光。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我最近情緒不太好。女兒自從結婚以來，就很少回來看我們了。我們之間的距離越來越大。雖說她每天要麼和我們打視頻電話，要麼給我們短信，但是卻少了很多面對面的交流。現在的技術很先進，我卻更想念那些溫馨的家庭氣氛，而不是冷冰冰的手機和電腦。我決定每個星期和所有家人一起聚一聚，忽略手機和電腦，珍惜我們在一起的時光。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ zuì jìn qíng xù bù tài hǎo。 nǚ ér zì cóng jié hūn yǐ lái， jiù hěn shǎo huí lái kàn wǒ men le。 wǒ men zhī jiān de jù lí yuè lái yuè dà。 suī shuō tā měi tiān yào me hé wǒ men dǎ shì pín diàn huà， yào me gěi wǒ men duǎn xìn， dàn shì què shǎo le hěn duō miàn duì miàn de jiāo liú。 xiàn zài de jì shù hěn xiān jìn， wǒ què gèng xiǎng niàn nà xiē wēn xīn de jiā tíng qì fēn， ér bù shì lěng bīng bīng de shǒu jī hé diàn nǎo。 wǒ jué dìng měi gè xīng qī hé suǒ yǒu jiā rén yī qǐ jù yī jù， hū lüè shǒu jī hé diàn nǎo， zhēn xī wǒ men zài yī qǐ de shí guāng。"], "english_paragraphs": ["I haven’t been feeling very happy lately. Ever since my daughter got married, she has rarely come home to visit us, and the distance between us keeps growing. She either video-calls us or sends us a text every day, but we have much less time to talk face-to-face. Technology is so advanced now, yet I miss the warmth of being together as a family more than I appreciate cold, impersonal phones and computers. I’ve decided that the whole family should get together once a week, put our phones and computers aside, and cherish our time together."], "english_full": "I haven’t been feeling very happy lately. Ever since my daughter got married, she has rarely come home to visit us, and the distance between us keeps growing. She either video-calls us or sends us a text every day, but we have much less time to talk face-to-face. Technology is so advanced now, yet I miss the warmth of being together as a family more than I appreciate cold, impersonal phones and computers. I’ve decided that the whole family should get together once a week, put our phones and computers aside, and cherish our time together.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuì jìn\" data-defn=\"recently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qíng xù\" data-defn=\"mood / state of mind / moodiness\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">情绪</span><span class=\"tr\">情緒</span><rt>qíng xù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tài\" data-defn=\"too (much) / very / extremely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"tr\">太</span><rt>tài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"good / appropriate; proper\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ ér\" data-defn=\"daughter\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zì cóng\" data-defn=\"since (a time) / ever since\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">自从</span><span class=\"tr\">自從</span><rt>zì cóng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jié hūn\" data-defn=\"to marry; to get married\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">结婚</span><span class=\"tr\">結婚</span><rt>jié hūn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǐ lái\" data-defn=\"since (used after a specified time or event)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">以来</s